  "interpretation": "<h3 data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"954\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"954\">Method:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1174\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"955\" data-end=\"1023\">\n<p data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1023\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"972\">ZN Staining</strong> &ndash; Ziehl-Neelsen Microscopy for Acid-Fast Bacilli</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1093\">\n<p data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1093\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1043\">Rapid Culture</strong> &ndash; Liquid Culture System (e.g., BACTEC MGIT 960)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1174\">\n<p data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1174\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1103\">PCR</strong> &ndash; Cartridge-Based Nucleic Acid Amplification Test (CBNAAT / GeneXpert)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1222\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\"><strong data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1222\">Clinical Use / Interpretation:</strong></span></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1403\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1403\">\n<p data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1277\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Detects <strong data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1263\">Mycobacterium tuberculosis</strong> and helps in:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1403\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1300\">\n<p data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1300\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Rapid TB diagnosis</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1352\">\n<p data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1352\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Identifying <strong data-start=\"1317\" data-end=\"1342\">rifampicin resistance</strong> (via PCR)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\" data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1403\">\n<p data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1403\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.38px;\">Differentiating viable organisms (via culture)</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
